.
.  Generate sample output for Cauchy PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na caupdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Cauchy PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT CAUPDF(X) FOR X = -5 0.01 5
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv caupdf.jpg ../gif100/caupdf.jpg
.
quit
